      "latest_changelog": "<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:41\"><a id=\"user-content-v120---2025-08-25---more-translations\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#v120---2025-08-25---more-translations\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a>v1.2.0 - 2025-08-25 - More Translations</h2>\r\n<ul dir=\"auto\" data-sourcepos=\"3:1-5:0\">\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:29\">Requires VS 1.21.0 or newer</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"4:1-5:0\">Switch to dotnet 8.0 and recompile</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:15\"><a id=\"user-content-new-features\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#new-features\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a>New Features</h3>\r\n<ul dir=\"auto\" data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:0\">\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:0\"><a class=\"gfm gfm-issue\" title=\"Reduce drop when damaging sheared entity\" href=\"https://gitlab.com/codesmiths/vs_shearlib/-/issues/24\" data-reference-type=\"issue\" data-original=\"#24\" data-link=\"false\" data-link-reference=\"false\" data-issue=\"172342680\" data-project=\"61882299\" data-iid=\"24\" data-namespace-path=\"codesmiths/vs_shearlib\" data-project-path=\"codesmiths/vs_shearlib\" data-issue-type=\"issue\" data-container=\"body\" data-placement=\"top\" data-popover-listener-added=\"true\">#24</a> - Dropped amount reduced to 1/3 of the animal is hurt during shearing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:12\"><a id=\"user-content-bug-fixes\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#bug-fixes\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a>Bug Fixes</h3>\r\n<ul dir=\"auto\" data-sourcepos=\"12:1-15:0\">\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"12:1-12:65\"><a class=\"gfm gfm-issue\" title=\"Prevent shearing of swimming or burning entities\" href=\"https://gitlab.com/codesmiths/vs_shearlib/-/issues/25\" data-reference-type=\"issue\" data-original=\"#25\" data-link=\"false\" data-link-reference=\"false\" data-issue=\"172362020\" data-project=\"61882299\" data-iid=\"25\" data-namespace-path=\"codesmiths/vs_shearlib\" data-project-path=\"codesmiths/vs_shearlib\" data-issue-type=\"issue\" data-container=\"body\" data-placement=\"top\" data-popover-listener-added=\"true\">#25</a> - Prevent shearing of burning, swimming or stressed animals</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:97\"><a class=\"gfm gfm-issue\" title=\"&#96;hoursPerUnitMaxReduction&#96; not applied correctly\" href=\"https://gitlab.com/codesmiths/vs_shearlib/-/issues/23\" data-reference-type=\"issue\" data-original=\"#23\" data-link=\"false\" data-link-reference=\"false\" data-issue=\"172342139\" data-project=\"61882299\" data-iid=\"23\" data-namespace-path=\"codesmiths/vs_shearlib\" data-project-path=\"codesmiths/vs_shearlib\" data-issue-type=\"issue\" data-container=\"body\" data-placement=\"top\" data-popover-listener-added=\"true\">#23</a> - <code data-sourcepos=\"13:9-13:34\">hoursPerUnitMaxReduction</code> was always used instead of <code data-sourcepos=\"13:63-13:97\">hoursPerUnitGenerationalReduction</code></li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"14:1-15:0\"><a class=\"gfm gfm-issue\" title=\"NullReferenceException in ShearLib 1.1.2 on client side during desync\" href=\"https://gitlab.com/codesmiths/vs_shearlib/-/issues/22\" data-reference-type=\"issue\" data-original=\"#22\" data-link=\"false\" data-link-reference=\"false\" data-issue=\"171204086\" data-project=\"61882299\" data-iid=\"22\" data-namespace-path=\"codesmiths/vs_shearlib\" data-project-path=\"codesmiths/vs_shearlib\" data-issue-type=\"issue\" data-container=\"body\" data-placement=\"top\" data-popover-listener-added=\"true\">#22</a> - Fix client-side exception when shearing (Thanx, Lantalia &amp; sekelsta!)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:23\"><a id=\"user-content-tweaks-and-balancing\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tweaks-and-balancing\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a>Tweaks and Balancing</h3>\r\n<ul dir=\"auto\" data-sourcepos=\"18:1-19:0\">\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"18:1-19:0\">The default for minimum generation to shear is now <strong>1</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-sourcepos=\"20:1-20:15\"><a id=\"user-content-translations\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#translations\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a>Translations</h3>\r\n<ul dir=\"auto\" data-sourcepos=\"22:1-24:0\">\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:47\"><a class=\"gfm gfm-issue\" title=\"Add Russian translation\" href=\"https://gitlab.com/codesmiths/vs_shearlib/-/issues/20\" data-reference-type=\"issue\" data-original=\"#20\" data-link=\"false\" data-link-reference=\"false\" data-issue=\"166069484\" data-project=\"61882299\" data-iid=\"20\" data-namespace-path=\"codesmiths/vs_shearlib\" data-project-path=\"codesmiths/vs_shearlib\" data-issue-type=\"issue\" data-container=\"body\" data-placement=\"top\" data-popover-listener-added=\"true\">#20</a> - Add Russian translation (Thanx, Morok!)</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"23:1-24:0\"><a class=\"gfm gfm-issue\" title=\"Add French translation\" href=\"https://gitlab.com/codesmiths/vs_shearlib/-/issues/19\" data-reference-type=\"issue\" data-original=\"#19\" data-link=\"false\" data-link-reference=\"false\" data-issue=\"166068904\" data-project=\"61882299\" data-iid=\"19\" data-namespace-path=\"codesmiths/vs_shearlib\" data-project-path=\"codesmiths/vs_shearlib\" data-issue-type=\"issue\" data-container=\"body\" data-placement=\"top\" data-popover-listener-added=\"true\">#19</a> - Add French translations (Thanx, Wailwolf!)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We hope you enjoy our work,</p>\r\n<p>Tels &amp; Phiwa 🤍</p>\r\n<pre><br />-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE----- <br /><br />iQIzBAABCgAdFiEEPNPwZPus2b38SDJdchBxoDxWlFcFAmistGoACgkQchBxoDxW <br />lFf1fQ//eGCsZptvthF/hIeZJjVcRqCIM9kfHAIY+aQ+DGYdQMMH7s1BgZHMjApd <br />CipsMF6P/+PAj841AEkuWJ+5vDdyiuvD9BjYothi5XtdZI2BEcHKGmOH4cY/rklv <br />/OAJV/6hiJ+AaatRa99Zp7IkBRPq69JtATG8a6quvKx7RnuuE7A25UcSymhDYLsm <br />vtVGOKhp8obQj8rQCDOd3RudM1UHolzT7D5soEyNyayekaHTIrkpDQI3/sf90loa <br />Okd1Qo0402UKS2JtL43i/wgBn2gVo+pMiQ9eg4TuArm78v8evTa/zMnPju35WQVj <br />FGAOCEtYMPg/QJwr3Z3FTrvz2kW6BA4y/JcaiwdGsI8zDhWYehCHFT1MUtnJq6Th <br />YbYh6TfmR